{% doc %}
  The MCP tools this app serves (pos-module-mcp spec 8.2). The engine reads its
  registry from this fixed app path, so every tool an instance offers is named
  in one reviewed app file; a module dropping tool files on disk cannot put a
  tool in front of an agent by itself.

  This is the reference copy for a desk that wants the support tools. An app
  with tools of its own adds them to the same array.
{% enddoc %}
{% liquid
  assign tools = []
  function support = 'modules/support/mcp/registry'
  assign tools = tools | concat: support
  return tools
%}
